        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To achieve this, we are building upon over three decades of leadership in Controlled Environment Agriculture (\"CEA\"), asset development and management, marketing of plant-based consumer packaged goods to deliver a full suite of recreational and medicinal products and brands to regulated cannabis markets across the world.",
        "start_character": 181,
        "end_character": 503
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-104189",
