        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our Canadian cannabis business is well-positioned for future growth with best-selling brands, backed by a low-cost large-scale structure and continued pursuit of future opportunities to expand sales, products and footprint in Canada and internationally.",
        "start_character": 15874,
        "end_character": 16138
      },
      {
